pl_mpeg.h from https://github.com/phoboslab/pl_mpeg (commit c871f2b), changed for Outbreak PC to also
decode MPEG-2 progressive frame pictures (the video in CRI Sofdec movies): picture coding and quant
matrix extensions, per-component f_codes, the non-linear quantiser, DCT table B-15, 12-bit escapes,
MPEG-2 inverse quantisation and mismatch control. The changes are under the same licence.

